&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Principal Security Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to serve as one of HelloFresh&#39;s most senior technical authorities in Security — shaping how we protect the company today while defining the security foundations we will need for the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a Principal role defined by ownership of a single security domain. &lt;strong&gt;Your domain is HelloFresh.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;technology strategy, security architecture, engineering and business risk&lt;/strong&gt;, influencing some of the most consequential technical decisions we make. You will partner with senior Engineering, Product, Data, IT and business leadership to ensure security is not something applied after strategic decisions are made, but a fundamental input into those decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You &lt;strong&gt;think in systems, not Initiatives — and in years, not quarters.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Where others see an IAM issue, application vulnerability, endpoint incident or AI risk, you look for the architectural condition connecting them. You ask not only &lt;em&gt;“How do we fix this?”&lt;/em&gt; but &lt;em&gt;“Why can this class of failure exist at HelloFresh, and what should we change so that it becomes difficult by design?”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your job is not merely to secure the systems HelloFresh has today. It is to influence what HelloFresh builds next, define the security architecture that makes it possible, and raise the technical capability of the organisation so that secure-by-default becomes a property of the company itself.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring exceptional breadth across &lt;strong&gt;Cloud Security, Application

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;em&gt;Senior CRM Manager - Transformation &lt;/em&gt;to make CRM Self-Service at HelloFresh a reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our central &lt;em&gt;Growth &lt;/em&gt;function has a clear vision: Enabling our local marketing and product teams to reach our customers directly, via push notifications, in-app messaging and emails. For this to work in an efficient and customer-centric way, the right guardrails, tools and knowledge need to be in place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your first mission is to design, launch and scale our CRM self-service model. You’ll do this hand in hand with our CreativeTech squad (Product and Engineering), who are building the future CRM environment in an AI-native way. You’ll work closely with the squad, and potentially be embedded in it. You’ll be the voice of CRM and of our internal users, helping define what this environment needs to look like so teams can send communications safely and independently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is 0-to-1 work in a highly ambiguous space where no one has been before: no playbook, no rules. AI and LLMs change fast and often, so you’ll think about what we need in the future, even if today’s models aren’t ready yet, and be prepared for when they catch up. The learning curve will be steep, but you’ll climb it on the go, together with the team. Our goal: protect our environment from the agents, and protect the agents from our environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From there, your focus will follow where CRM needs it most. You’ll take on further transformation projects, so this role is for someone who enjoys building something new and then moving on to the next challenge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Supply Chain planning working student for 12 months at the heart of our Product team, where you will be responsible for supporting our operational and strategic needs for our physical product: meal kits. You will be central to our activity and will have a significant influence on our customers&#39; meals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone capable of assisting us in the operational planning of recipes at HelloFresh. This is a unique opportunity to learn and gain experience within a fast-growing company that is pioneering the food industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to be a driving force in the growth of a scale-up, then this position is for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
